<title>UK: UK's Ofwat sets industry-wide price review in 1999.</title>
<headline>UK's Ofwat sets industry-wide price review in 1999.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Water industry regulator Ofwat said on Tuesday it plans to review the price limits for all the 29 water and sewage firms in England and Wales in 1999.</p>
</text>
